Description: HSYNC - file synchronization client
 HSYNC keeps directories in sync across machines and NAS devices.
 .
 Supports LAN peer-to-peer (no cloud) and remote server modes
 with real-time file watching, compression, and bandwidth control.
Depends: adduser, systemd
